msgstr "Sem umiestnite prilbu alebo pokrývku hlavy."

msgid "Place a chestplate or cuirass here."
msgstr "Sem umiestnite náprsný pancier."

msgid "Place a shield here."
msgstr "Sem umiestnite štít."

msgid "Place leggings or greaves here."
msgstr "Sem umiestnite nohavice."

msgid "Place boots here."
msgstr "Sem umiestnite topánky."

